e.\n\n\\[.\n3 + 5 = 8.\n\\].\n\n**Step 10:** Add the billions place.\n\n\\[.\n5 + 3 = 8.\n\\].\n\n**Final Sum:**.\n\n\\[. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
