 Add the ten thousands place:.\n\n\\[.\n7 + 8 = 15 \\quad (\\text{ten thousands place}).\n\\].\n- Write down **5** and carry over **1** to the next place.\n\n**Step 6:** Add the thousands place:.\n\n\\[.\n3 + 1 + 1 \\, (\\text{carried over}) = 5 \\quad (\\text{thousands place}).\n\\].\n\n**Step 7:** Add the hundreds place:.\n\n\\[.\n2 + 8 = 10 \\quad (\\text{hundreds place}).\n\\].\n- Write down **0** and carry over **1** to the next place.\n\n**Step 8:** Add the tens place:.\n\n\\[.\n5 + 1 + 1 \\, (\\text{carried over}) = 6 \\quad (\\text{tens place}).\n\\].\n\n**Step 9:** Add the ones place:.\n\n\\[.\n5 + 0 = 5 \\quad (\\text{ones place}).\n\\].\n\n**Final Sum:**.\n\n\\[. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
