d the hundreds place:.\n\n\\[.\n0 + 8 = 8.\n\\].\n\n**Step 8:** Add the ones place:.\n\n\\[.\n7 + 8 = 15 \\quad (\\text{Write } 5, \\text{ carry over } 1).\n\\].\n\n**Step 9:** Since there are no more digits to add, write the carried-over **1**.\n\n**Final Sum:**.\n\n\\[. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
