*.\n\n3. **Combine all the results:**.\n\n```.\n  137,931,054.\n+ 871,843,706.\n--------------.\n  1,009,774,760.\n```.\n\n**Final Answer:**.\n\n\\[. Therefore, my final answer is: "]] 42%|####2     | 212/500 [01:18<00:35,  8.01it/s] 43%|####2     | 213/500 [01:19<00:37,  7.61it/s]
