n\n\\[.\n7 + 9 + 1 (\\text{carried over}) = 17.\n\\].\n\nWrite down **7** and carry over **1** to the billions place.\n\n**Step 10:** Add the billions place:.\n\n\\[.\n0 + 2 + 1 (\\text{carried over}) = 3.\n\\].\n\n**Final Sum:**.\n\n\\[. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
