wn } 3 \\text{ and carry over } 1).\n\\].\n\n**Step 4:** Add the thousands place:.\n\n\\[.\n2 + 6 + 1 = 9 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 9 \\text{ and carry over } 0).\n\\].\n\n**Step 5:** Add the ten-thousands place:.\n\n\\[.\n7 + 5 = 12 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 2 \\text{ and carry over } 1).\n\\].\n\n**Step 6:** Add the hundred-thousands place:.\n\n\\[.\n0 + 6 + 1 = 7 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 7 \\text{ and carry over } 0).\n\\].\n\n**Step 7:** Add the millions place:.\n\n\\[.\n1 + 5 = 6 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 6 \\text{ and carry over } 0).\n\\].\n\n**Step 8:** Add the ten-millions place:.\n\n\\[.\n7 + 3 = 10 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 0 \\text{ and carry over } 1).\n\\].\n\n**Step 9:** Add the hundred-millions place:.\n\n\\[.\n0 + 7 + 1 = 8 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 8).\n\\].\n\n**Final Sum:**.\n\n\\[. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
