 place:.\n\n\\[.\n1 + 7 + 1 = 9.\n\\].\n\n**Step 7:** Add the millions place:.\n\n\\[.\n6 + 5 = 11 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 1 \\text{ and carry over } 1).\n\\].\n\n**Step 8:** Add the ten-millions place:.\n\n\\[.\n8 + 5 + 1 = 14 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 14).\n\\].\n\nPutting it all together:.\n\n\\[.\n\\begin{array}{r}.\n\\phantom{0}681,\\!299,\\!830 \\\\.\n+571,\\!800,\\!877 \\\\.\n\\hline.\n1,\\!253,\\!100,\\!707 \\\\.\n\\end{array}.\n\\].\n\n**Final Answer:**.\n\n\\[. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
