sands place.\n\n**Step 6:** Add the hundred-thousands place:.\n\n\\[.\n3 + 8 + 10 = 21.\n\\].\n\nWrite down **1** and carry over **10** to the millions place.\n\n**Step 7:** Add the millions place:.\n\n\\[.\n7 + 1 + 10 = 18.\n\\].\n\nWrite down **8** and carry over **10** to the ten-millions place.\n\n**Step 8:** Add the ten-millions place:.\n\n\\[.\n8 + 3 + 10 = 21.\n\\].\n\nWrite down **1** and carry over **10** to the hundred-millions place.\n\n**Step 9:** Add the hundred-millions place:.\n\n\\[.\n2 + 1 + 10 = 13.\n\\].\n\nWrite down **13**.\n\n**Final Sum:**.\n\n\\[. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
