\\].\n\n**Step 8:** Add the ten-millions place:.\n\n\\[.\n8 + 6 = 14 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 4 \\text{ and carry over } 1).\n\\].\n\n**Step 9:** Since there's a carried-over \\(1\\) with no higher place value, add it to the front.\n\n\\[. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
