own **9**.\n- **Hundred-thousands place:** \\(0 + 4 = 4\\) → Write down **4**.\n- **Millions place:** \\(9 + 9 = 18\\) → Write down **8** and carry over **1**.\n- **Ten-millions place:** \\(8 + 0 + 1 = 9\\) → Write down **9**.\n- **Hundred-millions place:** \\(8 + 9 = 17\\) → Write down **7** and carry over **1**.\n- **Billions place:** \\(0 + 0 + 1 = 1\\) → Write down **1**.\n\n**Step 3:** Combine all the results.\n\n\\[.\n\\begin{array}{ccccccccccc}.\n& 1 & 8 & 8 & 3 & 6 & 1 & 2 & 3 & 0 & 2 \\\\.\n\\end{array}.\n\\].\n\n**Final Answer:**.\n\n\\[. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
