 down } 8 \\text{, carry over } 1).\n\\].\n\n**Step 3:** Add the hundreds place:.\n\n\\[.\n4 + 6 = 10 \\quad (\\text{Add carried over } 1 \\rightarrow 11) \\quad (\\text{Write down } 1 \\text{, carry over } 1).\n\\].\n\n**Step 4:** Add the thousands place:.\n\n\\[.\n9 + 5 = 14 \\quad (\\text{Add carried over } 1 \\rightarrow 15) \\quad (\\text{Write down } 5 \\text{, carry over } 1).\n\\].\n\n**Step 5:** Add the ten-thousands place:.\n\n\\[.\n5 + 4 = 9 \\quad (\\text{Add carried over } 1 \\rightarrow 10) \\quad (\\text{Write down } 0 \\text{, carry over } 1).\n\\].\n\n**Step 6:** Add the hundred-thousands place:.\n\n\\[.\n7 + 8 = 15 \\quad (\\text{Add carried over } 1 \\rightarrow 16) \\quad (\\text{Write down } 6 \\text{, carry over } 1).\n\\].\n\n**Step 7:** Add the millions place:.\n\n\\[.\n2 + 7 = 9 \\quad (\\text{Add carried over } 1 \\rightarrow 10) \\quad (\\text{Write down } 0 \\text{, carry over } 1).\n\\].\n\n**Step 8:** Add the ten-millions place:.\n\n\\[.\n0 + 0 = 0 \\quad (\\text{Add carried over } 1 \\rightarrow 1).\n\\].\n\nPutting it all together:.\n\n\\[. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
